  "solution": {
    "idea": "<p><code>dp[i][j] = dp[i-1][j] + dp[i][j-1]</code>，墙的位置保持 0，起点 <code>dp[0][0] = 1</code>。</p><p>先在 3x3 这种小格子上手算一遍和程序对；再把无障碍的情况和 <code>math.comb(n+m-2, n-1)</code> 对一次，两边都一致才算写对。</p>",
    "code": "\"\"\"p14 网格路径数：0 是空格 1 是墙，从左上角到右下角只能向右或向下，数一数几条路。\ndp[i][j] = 到达 (i,j) 的路径数 = 上面来的 + 左边来的；墙的位置直接留 0。\nPython 大整数不会溢出，所以路径数可以完整打印出来。\n\"\"\"\nimport sys\n\n\ndef count_paths(grid, n, m):\n    if grid[0][0] == '1' or grid[n - 1][m - 1] == '1':\n        return 0\n    dp = [[0] * m for _ in range(n)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(m):\n            if (i == 0 and j == 0) or grid[i][j] == '1':\n                continue\n            v = 0\n            if i > 0:\n                v += dp[i - 1][j]\n            if j > 0:\n                v += dp[i][j - 1]\n            dp[i][j] = v\n    return dp[n - 1][m - 1]\n\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    n, m = int(data[0]), int(data[1])\n    grid = data[2:2 + n]\n    print(count_paths(grid, n, m))\n\n\nmain()\n",
    "output": "$ python p14_grid_paths.py\n输入：3 3\n000\n010\n000\n\n输出：2\r\n",
    "reference": "code/ch13-real-problems/09_paths.py"
  }
